The WebGL2 CRT renderer is adapted from cool-retro-term by Filippo
Scognamiglio, upstream commit 1394ce82fa53d2a87d5adc4d99f9eeba598ea53d.
Original GLSL, QML pipeline sources, and the original noise image are retained
under crt/upstream and crt/. The browser port follows the Default Amber
pipeline, including its static curvature and bloom pass, dynamic phosphor,
noise, jitter and burn-in pass, display frame, and low-resolution Terminess
glyph raster. Qt's multi-level FastBlur shader source is from Qt 5 Compatibility
Graphical Effects, commit 6c5a26d46016c652bf520aaff18a6d874d400e34.

The CRT source and assets, including the Terminess font and Qt-derived blur
source, have their own attribution and license details in crt/NOTICE.md and
crt/fonts/LICENSE-Terminess.txt. The font remains under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1. The renderer adaptation is distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later.

